Z||000007||BlackDragon||09-04-2001||12:44 AM||||racing with an ET sucks, i prefer straight out racing. the person that reaches the finish line first wins. i wonder what kind of times a v8 fiero would bring in??? <P>------------------<BR>im looking for a inexpensive black standard fastback. does not have to run. does not have to look good. only the mid section needs to be dent free. the fenders,bumpers, dont have to be in good cond. faded paint is fine. anyone who has info, email me. grey interior would be nice but beggars cant be choosers||||reg||1
